esis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x\">\\(\\dot x\\)</span> (forcing name, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (forcing-poset carrier) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (support-index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}:P\\to\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}:P\\to\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> (condition-support map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq I\">\\(S\\subseteq I\\)</span> (hereditary support)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12HereditaryNameSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12HereditaryNameSet}_S\\)</span> (hereditary-name-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"91f02e9ed50ca253\" href=\"?note=91f02e9ed50ca253\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-forcing12-hereditary-name-set.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-hereditary-name-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NameHereditarySupport}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NameHereditarySupport}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}name\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NameHereditarySupport}_S(\\dot x,S,P,I,\\operatorname{supp})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{supp}:P\\to\\mathcal P(I)\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(H=\\bigcap\\{K\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12HereditaryNameSet}_S(K,\\dot x,P)\\}\\land S=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{supp}(p)\\mid\\exists\\rho\\in H\\;\\